            </div>
            <div class="b-spec">
              <p class="b-spec-role">小標 · 蘭陽黑體</p>
              <p
                class="b-spec-sample"
                style="font-family:'jf-lanyanghei','Noto Sans TC'"
              >
                黑體也能寫出詩意
              </p>
              <p class="b-spec-name">jf-lanyanghei → 骨架 Noto Sans TC</p>
            </div>
            <div class="b-spec">
              <p class="b-spec-role">引言 · 蘭陽明體</p>
              <p
                class="b-spec-sample"
                style="font-family:'jf-lanyangming','Noto Serif TC'"
              >
                從宜蘭的水看見字的可能
              </p>
              <p class="b-spec-name">jf-lanyangming → 骨架 Noto Serif TC</p>
            </div>
            <div class="b-spec">
              <p class="b-spec-role">文章大標 · 日星宋體貳號</p>
              <p
                class="b-spec-sample"
                style="font-family:'rixingsong-semibold','Noto Serif TC'"
